      "q": "What are the rules of Sudoku 6x6?",
      "a": "Place numbers 1 to 6 such that every row, column, and each of the six 2x3 blocks contains all digits 1 through 6 without repeats."
    },
    {
      "q": "Why play Sudoku 6x6 over 9x9?",
      "a": "It takes just 2 minutes per match, making it the ideal quick brain warmup and great for casual play on mobile phones."
    },
    {
      "q": "How do subgrids work in 6x6?",
